    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "DIA Studio is a design, research and innovation studio co-founded in 2009 in SoHo, New York by Mitch Paone (Creative Director) and Meg Donohoe (Managing Director). Now dual-based in New York and Chamonix, France. Known for kinetic identity systems, typographic systems, and generative tools; clients include Coinbase, Pinterest, Nike, Adidas, Squarespace, Spotify and YouTube. Mitch Paone is an AGI member who teaches at European institutions (ECAL, ZHDK, KABK, HEAD). Small team of 2 founders plus likely a handful of collaborators, consistent with the 2-10 size. Country was Switzerland in migration data; their own About page says New York, Chamonix (Chamonix is in France), corrected here.",
